title Cassette state (PLAY/PAUSE key, hubs, meter): a recording paused: REC and PAUSE latched, the hubs still
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO paused
env CASSETTE_ANIM_TICKS 2
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 600
shot state-rec-paused
expect text "PAUSE"
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
